export function compareObservedClusterTiming({cluster,window,uploadAt}={}){const a=stamp(cluster?.start),b=stamp(cluster?.end),ws=stamp(window?.start),we=stamp(window?.end),u=stamp(uploadAt);if(a===null||b===null||a>b)throw Error('Invalid sampled fix interval');let status='unavailable';if(ws!==null&&we!==null&&ws<=we)status=b<ws?'before_window':a>we?'after_window':a>=ws&&b<=we?'within_window':'overlaps_boundary';const seconds=u===null?null:u<a?(a-u)/1000:u>b?(u-b)/1000:0;return {observedFixWindowComparison:{status,basis:'sampled_fix_interval_only'},uploadToObservedFixInterval:{status:u===null?'unavailable':'measured',seconds,direction:u===null?null:u<a?'before_interval':u>b?'after_interval':'within_interval',basis:'sampled_fix_interval_only'}};}
